TI  - Synthetic Examples Improve Generalization for Rare Classes
PY  - 2020
T2  - 2020 IEEE Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision (WACV)
SP  - 852
EP  - 862
DO  - 10.1109/WACV45572.2020.9093570
