TI  - EgoTL: Egocentric Think-Aloud Chains for Long-Horizon Tasks
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition- FINDINGS Track (CVPRF)
SP  - 2017
EP  - 2027
DO  - 10.1109/CVPRF71909.2026.00198
